      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>[... upon our master and lord the im\u0101m al-Mus]tan\u1e63ir bi-All\u0101h, commander of the faithful [and upon]</li>\n<li>his pure ancestors. The slave of our master, the blessings of God be upon him, reports to</li>\n<li>the pure presence that he is enduring detention in the arsenal and that</li>\n<li>he has received due punishment. He requests a kindness and benefaction</li>\n<li>to be done to him by being charitable, in consideration of this, to his family, his children and his</li>\n<li>crippled mother, who have stood ransom for him. To our master, the blessings of God be upon him, belongs the exalted opinion regarding that, if God wills.</li>\n<li>Praise be to God alone and his blessings be upon our lord Mu\u1e25ammad, his prophet, and his pure family and save them.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
